{{!
    @template local_dimensions/filter_line

    The filter line of a learner view (moodle-dev/docs/filter-line/CONTRACT.md): one sticky
    toolbar holding the line, in the contract's slot order, and the row of chips under it.

    The line (local-dimensions-line) holds, in order: the scope, a radio group of counted cells
    whose roving focus and arrow keys local_dimensions/filter_line adds, a cell with nothing to
    offer written hidden (absent) unless it is the chosen one; the pill search with its magnifier
    and its eraser, which is never a cross; the favourites star (aria-pressed), hidden while the
    learner has no favourite; Filters, which opens the chip panel (aria-expanded, aria-controls)
    and carries a count badge; Organise, which opens the sort menu and, at the two-line step, the
    view toggle's place ("Show as"); the view toggle, icons only, List first. A surface leaves out
    the slots it does not have and never reorders the rest.

    Every control the search slides out of the way when it grows over the line carries
    local-dimensions-line-slides. Four parts are the module's alone, and the stylesheet draws none of them until the module has
    folded the line into a step (local-dimensions-line--s1 to s4): the search's icon
    (local-dimensions-search-open), which stands for the field once the line is too narrow for
    it; the close button of the search grown over the line (local-dimensions-search-close), the
    line's last control; the listbox of suggestions, given its role by the module, which carries
    its three headings so the module composes no word of them; and the "Show as" group.

    The row under the line (local-dimensions-line-chips) holds a chip per active filter, each a
    button that drops it, and "Clear all" from two chips up; the module paints it, reading the
    words of each chip off the control it stands for and the remove label off the row.

    Every floating layer - the panel, the menu, the listbox - names a region: the module places
    each one under the line's real bottom, and the panel becomes a bottom sheet at the two-line
    step. The panel's foot is "Show N", which closes it on the list; the module keeps N current.

    Context variables required:
    * id (string) - Prefix of every id the line writes
    * scopelabel (string) - Accessible name of the scope group
    * scopehidden (bool) - Whether the scope waits for its counts (the tracker's do)
    * scope (array) - Cells: value, label, count, hascount, checked, absent
    * searchlabel, searchplaceholder (string) - The field's name and placeholder
    * itemslabel (string) - Heading of the matching items in the suggestions
    * hasstar (bool), star (object) - pressed, count, hidden
    * haschipfilters (bool), chipfilters (object) - The chip panel's context
    * showcount (int) - How many items the list shows at first paint, on the panel's "Show N"
    * hasorganise (bool), sortoptions (array) - value, label, checked
    * hasviews (bool), views (array) - value, label, icon, current

    @copyright  2026 Anderson Blaine
    @license    http://www.gnu.org/copyleft/gpl.html GNU GPL v3 or later

    Example context (json):
    {
        "id": "local-dimensions-viewplan",
        "scopelabel": "Filter competencies",
        "scopehidden": false,
        "scope": [
            {"value": "incomplete", "label": "To do", "count": 3, "hascount": true, "checked": true, "absent": false},
            {"value": "all", "label": "All", "count": 5, "hascount": true, "checked": false, "absent": false}
        ],
        "searchlabel": "Search competencies",
        "searchplaceholder": "Search competencies…",
        "itemslabel": "Competencies",
        "hasstar": true,
        "star": {"pressed": false, "count": 2, "hidden": false},
        "haschipfilters": true,
        "showcount": 3,
        "chipfilters": {
            "id": "local-dimensions-viewplan-chip-filters",
            "hasgroups": true,
            "clearlabel": "Clear filters",
            "groups": [
                {
                    "shortname": "local_dimensions_tag1",
                    "groupid": "tag1",
                    "label": "Year",
                    "values": [{"value": "2025"}, {"value": "2026"}]
                }
            ]
        },
        "hasorganise": true,
        "sortoptions": [
            {"value": "planorder", "label": "Plan order", "checked": true},
            {"value": "name", "label": "Name", "checked": false}
        ],
        "hasviews": true,
        "views": [
            {"value": "list", "label": "List", "icon": "fa-list", "current": true},
            {"value": "grid", "label": "Cards", "icon": "fa-th-large", "current": false}
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="local-dimensions-toolbar" data-region="local-dimensions-line-toolbar">
    <div class="local-dimensions-line" data-region="local-dimensions-line">
        <div class="local-dimensions-line-scope" role="radiogroup" aria-label="{{scopelabel}}" data-region="local-dimensions-line-scope"{{#scopehidden}} hidden{{/scopehidden}}>
            <div class="local-dimensions-line-cells">
                {{#scope}}
                <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-cell" role="radio" data-filter="{{value}}" aria-checked="{{#checked}}true{{/checked}}{{^checked}}false{{/checked}}" tabindex="{{#checked}}0{{/checked}}{{^checked}}-1{{/checked}}"{{#absent}} hidden{{/absent}}>{{label}} <span class="local-dimensions-line-count" data-count="{{value}}"{{^hascount}} hidden{{/hascount}}>{{count}}</span></button>
                {{/scope}}
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="local-dimensions-line-search" data-region="local-dimensions-line-search">
            <label class="local-dimensions-line-sronly" for="{{id}}-search">{{searchlabel}}</label>
            <i class="fa fa-search local-dimensions-line-searchicon" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            <input type="search" id="{{id}}-search" class="local-dimensions-search-input" placeholder="{{searchplaceholder}}" autocomplete="off">
            <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-eraser" data-action="local-dimensions-search-clear" aria-label="{{#str}}line_clear_text, local_dimensions{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}line_clear_text, local_dimensions{{/str}}" hidden><i class="fa fa-eraser" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-iconbtn local-dimensions-line-searchopen local-dimensions-line-slides" data-action="local-dimensions-search-open" aria-controls="{{id}}-search" aria-expanded="false" aria-label="{{searchlabel}}" title="{{searchlabel}}"><i class="fa fa-search" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        {{#hasstar}}
        {{#star}}
        <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-iconbtn local-dimensions-line-star local-dimensions-line-slides" data-region="local-dimensions-line-star" aria-pressed="{{#pressed}}true{{/pressed}}{{^pressed}}false{{/pressed}}" title="{{#str}}line_favourites, local_dimensions{{/str}}"{{#hidden}} hidden{{/hidden}}><i class="fa {{#pressed}}fa-star{{/pressed}}{{^pressed}}fa-star-o{{/pressed}}" aria-hidden="true"></i><span class="local-dimensions-line-sronly">{{#str}}line_favourites, local_dimensions{{/str}} <span data-fav-count>{{count}}</span></span></button>
        {{/star}}
        {{/hasstar}}
        {{#haschipfilters}}
        <div class="local-dimensions-line-filters local-dimensions-line-slides">
            <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-filterstoggle" data-filter-toggle aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="{{id}}-panel"><i class="fa fa-sliders" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span class="local-dimensions-line-label">{{#str}}line_filters, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span> <span class="local-dimensions-line-badge" data-chip-count hidden></span></button>
            <div class="local-dimensions-filter-panel" id="{{id}}-panel" data-filter-panel data-region="local-dimensions-line-panel" hidden>
                {{#chipfilters}}
                {{> local_dimensions/chip_filters }}
                {{/chipfilters}}
                <div class="local-dimensions-line-panelfoot">
                    <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-show" data-action="local-dimensions-panel-show">{{#str}}line_show, local_dimensions{{/str}} <span data-region="local-dimensions-panel-count">{{showcount}}</span></button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/haschipfilters}}
        {{#hasorganise}}
        <div class="local-dimensions-line-organise local-dimensions-line-slides">
            <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-iconbtn local-dimensions-sort-toggle" data-sort-toggle aria-haspopup="true" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="{{id}}-organise" aria-label="{{#str}}line_organise, local_dimensions{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}line_organise, local_dimensions{{/str}}"><i class="fa fa-sort-amount-asc" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
            <div class="local-dimensions-line-menu" id="{{id}}-organise" data-region="local-dimensions-line-menu" hidden>
                <div class="local-dimensions-sort-menu" role="menu" aria-labelledby="{{id}}-sortby">
                    <span class="local-dimensions-sort-heading" id="{{id}}-sortby">{{#str}}sort_by, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
                    {{#sortoptions}}
                    <button type="button" role="menuitemradio" data-sort="{{value}}" aria-checked="{{#checked}}true{{/checked}}{{^checked}}false{{/checked}}"><i class="fa fa-check" aria-hidden="true"></i>{{label}}</button>
                    {{/sortoptions}}
                </div>
                {{#hasviews}}
                <div class="local-dimensions-line-showas" role="group" aria-labelledby="{{id}}-showas" data-region="local-dimensions-line-showas">
                    <span class="local-dimensions-sort-heading" id="{{id}}-showas">{{#str}}line_show_as, local_dimensions{{/str}}</span>
                    {{#views}}
                    <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-showasbtn" data-view="{{value}}" aria-pressed="{{#current}}true{{/current}}{{^current}}false{{/current}}"><i class="fa {{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i> {{label}}</button>
                    {{/views}}
                </div>
                {{/hasviews}}
            </div>
        </div>
        {{/hasorganise}}
        {{#hasviews}}
        <div class="local-dimensions-view-toggle local-dimensions-line-view local-dimensions-line-slides" role="group" aria-label="{{#str}}line_view, local_dimensions{{/str}}" data-region="local-dimensions-line-view">
            {{#views}}
            <button type="button" data-view="{{value}}" aria-pressed="{{#current}}true{{/current}}{{^current}}false{{/current}}" aria-label="{{label}}" title="{{label}}"><i class="fa {{icon}}" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
            {{/views}}
        </div>
        {{/hasviews}}
        <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-iconbtn local-dimensions-line-searchclose" data-action="local-dimensions-search-close" aria-label="{{#str}}line_close_search, local_dimensions{{/str}}" title="{{#str}}line_close_search, local_dimensions{{/str}}"><i class="fa fa-times" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
        <div class="local-dimensions-line-suggest" id="{{id}}-suggest" data-region="local-dimensions-line-suggest" data-label-filters="{{#str}}line_suggest_filters, local_dimensions{{/str}}" data-label-start="{{#str}}line_suggest_start, local_dimensions{{/str}}" data-label-items="{{itemslabel}}" hidden></div>
    </div>
    <div class="local-dimensions-line-chips" data-region="local-dimensions-line-chips" data-label-remove="{{#str}}line_remove_filter, local_dimensions{{/str}}" hidden>
        <div class="local-dimensions-line-chiplist" data-region="local-dimensions-line-chiplist"></div>
        <button type="button" class="local-dimensions-line-clearall" data-action="local-dimensions-clear-all" hidden>{{#str}}line_clear_all, local_dimensions{{/str}}</button>
    </div>
</div>
